' S-612 (2026-10-17): a PARAMETER with the routine's own name is the parameter, not the result variable. The AST interpreter zeroed it when the
' call began (Deger(4) returned 1); after the S-599 result-variable initialization the MIR-based engines did the same for a FUNCTION (Topla(4) -> 1).
CLASS Say
    PUBLIC
    METHOD Deger(deger AS I32) AS I32
        RETURN deger + 1
    END METHOD
END CLASS
FUNCTION Topla(topla AS I32) AS I32
    RETURN topla + 1
END FUNCTION
DIM s AS Say = NEW Say()
PRINT s.Deger(4)
PRINT Topla(4)
